{"version":"0.2","scenes":[{"id":"title","template":"title-hook","narration":{"en":"Every time you open a page, a message races across the world and back. Let's follow it.","ar":"في كل مرة تفتح فيها صفحة، تنطلق رسالة عبر العالم وتعود. لنتتبّعها معًا."},"content":{"title":{"en":"How the internet carries a message","ar":"كيف ينقل الإنترنت رسالتك"},"icon":"wifi"}},{"id":"net-home","template":"canvas","narration":{"en":"At home, your phone and laptop reach the router by Wi-Fi, and the desktop by cable. The router sends each request out to the internet, and the answer comes back the same way.","ar":"في البيت، يصل هاتفك وحاسوبك المحمول إلى الموجّه عبر الواي فاي، ويصل الحاسوب المكتبي بكابل. يرسل الموجّه كل طلب إلى الإنترنت، ويعود الجواب من الطريق نفسه."},"content":{"elements":[{"id":"h","type":"text","x":80,"y":48,"w":1120,"size":46,"weight":800,"text":{"en":"Your home network","ar":"شبكة بيتك"}},{"id":"net","x":80,"y":150,"w":1120,"h":540,"type":"topology","layout":"star","devices":[{"id":"router","kind":"router","label":{"en":"Home router","ar":"الموجّه المنزلي"},"note":"192.168.1.1","range":194},{"id":"phone","kind":"phone","label":{"en":"Phone","ar":"الهاتف"},"note":"192.168.1.20"},{"id":"laptop","kind":"laptop","label":{"en":"Laptop","ar":"الحاسوب المحمول"},"note":"192.168.1.21"},{"id":"desktop","kind":"desktop","label":{"en":"Desktop","ar":"الحاسوب المكتبي"},"note":"192.168.1.22"},{"id":"net","kind":"cloud","label":{"en":"The internet","ar":"الإنترنت"}}],"links":[{"from":"phone","to":"router","kind":"wireless"},{"from":"laptop","to":"router","kind":"wireless"},{"from":"desktop","to":"router"},{"from":"router","to":"net"}],"routes":[{"path":["phone","router","net"],"label":{"en":"Request","ar":"طلب"}},{"path":["net","router","phone"],"label":{"en":"Answer","ar":"الجواب"},"tone":"ok"}],"anim":[{"prop":"reveal","keys":[{"at":0.3,"value":0},{"at":{"word":{"en":"cable","ar":"بكابل"},"offset":0.3},"value":1,"ease":"linear"}]},{"prop":"focus","keys":[{"at":{"word":{"en":"router","ar":"الموجّه"}},"value":1,"ease":"step"},{"at":{"word":{"en":"sends","ar":"يرسل"}},"value":0,"ease":"step"}]},{"prop":"frame","keys":[{"at":{"word":{"en":"sends","ar":"يرسل"}},"value":0},{"at":{"word":{"en":"sends","ar":"يرسل"},"offset":2.2},"value":1,"ease":"in-out"},{"at":{"word":{"en":"answer","ar":"الجواب"}},"value":1},{"at":{"word":{"en":"answer","ar":"الجواب"},"offset":2.2},"value":2,"ease":"in-out"}]}]}]}},{"id":"net-path","template":"canvas","narration":{"en":"A message from your laptop doesn't fly straight to the website. It hops from your home router to your internet provider, then across the internet, router by router, until it reaches the server.","ar":"لا تطير رسالتك من الحاسوب إلى الموقع مباشرة. بل تقفز من موجّه البيت إلى مزوّد الإنترنت، ثم عبر الإنترنت من موجّه إلى موجّه، حتى تصل إلى الخادم."},"content":{"elements":[{"id":"h","type":"text","x":80,"y":48,"w":1120,"size":46,"weight":800,"text":{"en":"Across the internet","ar":"عبر الإنترنت"}},{"id":"net","x":80,"y":150,"w":1120,"h":540,"type":"topology","layout":"line","devices":[{"id":"laptop","kind":"laptop","label":{"en":"Your laptop","ar":"حاسوبك"}},{"id":"home","kind":"router","label":{"en":"Home router","ar":"موجّه البيت"}},{"id":"isp","kind":"tower","label":{"en":"Internet provider","ar":"مزوّد الإنترنت"}},{"id":"net","kind":"cloud","label":{"en":"Routers on the way","ar":"موجّهات في الطريق"}},{"id":"site","kind":"server","label":{"en":"The website","ar":"الموقع"}}],"links":[{"from":"laptop","to":"home","kind":"wireless"},{"from":"home","to":"isp"},{"from":"isp","to":"net"},{"from":"net","to":"site"}],"zones":[{"devices":["laptop","home"],"label":{"en":"Your home","ar":"بيتك"}},{"devices":["isp","net"],"label":{"en":"The internet","ar":"الإنترنت"}}],"routes":[{"path":["laptop","home","isp","net","site"],"label":{"en":"Request","ar":"طلب"}},{"path":["site","net","isp","home","laptop"],"label":{"en":"Page","ar":"الصفحة"},"tone":"ok"}],"anim":[{"prop":"reveal","keys":[{"at":0.3,"value":0},{"at":{"word":{"en":"website","ar":"الموقع"},"offset":0.4},"value":1,"ease":"linear"}]},{"prop":"frame","keys":[{"at":{"word":{"en":"hops","ar":"تقفز"}},"value":0},{"at":{"word":{"en":"server","ar":"الخادم"},"offset":0.6},"value":1,"ease":"linear"}]},{"prop":"focus","keys":[{"at":{"word":{"en":"provider","ar":"مزوّد"}},"value":3,"ease":"step"},{"at":{"word":{"en":"server","ar":"الخادم"}},"value":5,"ease":"step"}]}]}]}},{"id":"net-dns","template":"canvas","narration":{"en":"Your phone only knows the name school.example. It asks a DNS resolver, which asks the name servers. The address comes back, your phone keeps it, and only then does it ask the website for the page.","ar":"لا يعرف هاتفك إلا الاسم school.example. فيسأل محلّل الأسماء، الذي يسأل خوادم الأسماء. يعود العنوان، فيحفظه هاتفك، وبعدها فقط يطلب الصفحة من الموقع."},"content":{"elements":[{"id":"h","type":"text","x":80,"y":48,"w":1120,"size":46,"weight":800,"text":{"en":"Finding a website: DNS","ar":"العثور على موقع: DNS"}},{"id":"flow","x":80,"y":150,"w":1120,"h":540,"type":"sequence","participants":[{"id":"phone","glyph":"phone","label":{"en":"Your phone","ar":"هاتفك"}},{"id":"dns","glyph":"server","label":{"en":"DNS resolver","ar":"محلّل الأسماء"}},{"id":"ns","glyph":"globe","label":{"en":"Name servers","ar":"خوادم الأسماء"}},{"id":"site","glyph":"server","label":{"en":"The website","ar":"الموقع"}}],"messages":[{"from":"phone","to":"dns","label":{"en":"Where is school.example?","ar":"أين school.example؟"}},{"from":"dns","to":"ns","label":{"en":"Who has school.example?","ar":"من يعرف school.example؟"}},{"from":"ns","to":"dns","label":{"en":"203.0.113.10","ar":"203.0.113.10"},"reply":true},{"from":"dns","to":"phone","label":{"en":"203.0.113.10","ar":"203.0.113.10"},"reply":true},{"from":"phone","to":"site","label":{"en":"Page, please (to 203.0.113.10)","ar":"الصفحة من فضلك (إلى 203.0.113.10)"}}],"notes":[{"after":4,"over":["phone"],"text":{"en":"Kept for next time","ar":"يحفظه للمرة القادمة"}}],"anim":[{"prop":"re